@begin(aside)
A known HTML block element renders as itself.
@end(aside)

@begin(section)[Intro]{id="s1"}
Another known element; the label becomes a data attribute.
@end(section)

@begin(.aside)
A leading dot forces the class form even for a known element.
@end(.aside)

@begin(sidebar)
An unknown one-word name stays a div with the name as its class.
@end(sidebar)

@begin(<sidebar>)
The angle-bracket sigil forces an element even for an unknown name.
@end(sidebar)
